# Builds are release assets, never files in this repository: git refuses a file over
# 100 MB, and a smaller one stays in the history for good. Attach them to a release on
# github.com instead (Releases → Draft a new release → Attach binaries).
*.zip
*.zip.*
*.apk
*.aab
*.exe
*.pck
*.dll

# macOS Finder
.DS_Store
